cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "serdes-link: a 5 Gb/s serial link model with SystemVerilog digital blocks"
authors:
  - family-names: Pham
    given-names: Jack
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/jackpham-rgb/serdes-link"
abstract: >-
  A 5 Gb/s NRZ serial link modeled in Python from the transmitter to the
  recovered bits (channel, TX FFE, CTLE, DFE, bang-bang CDR, statistical
  eye and BER), with the PRBS generator, DFE, and CDR loop filter rebuilt
  in SystemVerilog and checked against the model with cocotb.
keywords:
  - serdes
  - signal integrity
  - equalization
  - clock and data recovery
  - systemverilog
  - cocotb
